{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37630","headline":"丞相孟夏祗荐南郊纪献十韵 · 郑谷","name":"丞相孟夏祗荐南郊纪献十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"节应清和候，郊宫事洁羞。\n至诚闻上帝，明德祀圆丘。\n雅用陶匏器，馨非黍稷流。\n就阳陈盛礼，匡国祷鸿休。\n渐晓兰迎露，微凉麦弄秋。\n寿山横紫阁，瑞霭抱皇州。\n外肃通班序，中严锡庆优。\n奏歌三酒备，表敬百神柔。\n池碧将还凤，原清再问牛。\n万方瞻辅翼，共贺赞皇猷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37630.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37630","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}